<title>USA: Smith Barney wins San Francisco Airports $118 mln.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney wins San Francisco Airports $118 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $118 million of Airports Commission of the city and county of San Francisco, Calif., International Airport second series revenue bonds, issue 13B and 14, AMT, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.809 percent.</p>
</text>
